- **Silent caching downloads** (commit `a95c31f`): cache-ahead `downloadNextSong` enqueues with
  `silent: true`; `DownloadBanner` and the per-song `%`/clock indicators in `SongItem` skip silent
  items (via `getSongState`), so auto-caching runs invisibly. Manual downloads still animate.
