  both players; deleted the dead `queueBox`/`upNextBox` refs (leftovers from `measureInWindow`); renamed
  `QueueDragRow.js` → `QueueDrag.js` (file holds provider + row) and tidied the provider (dropped redundant
  `key` from registered rows, inlined the up-region helper).
