  capped at 70% of the container (no overflow on short screens); title/TimeBar/controls drop below it.
  Desktop unchanged (already half-width/full-height).
- **DnD polish** (`QueueDrag.js`): sibling spring stiffened (`friction 7/60` → `friction 10/tension 140` +
  `overshootClamping: true`) so the gap opens and rows snap back without the elastic bounce/overshoot;
  cross-section target switching now has a `±rowHeight/2` hysteresis dead-band around the up-next box
  bottom — the section only flips when the finger clearly crosses, so near-boundary drags no longer flicker
  between Up next/Queue or land at the far edge of the wrong section. Same-section drops stay exact.
