## 2026-08-28 — Fix radio loop (same 50) + exclusions never filtering
- Root cause 1 (loop): `settings.repeatQueue` defaults true (`contexts/settings.js:109`), and
  `playerCore.nextSong` gated the radio top-up on `!global.repeatQueue` → repeat ON skipped the
  extend branch → queue wrapped via modulo → same 50 loop forever. Fix: at the last index,
  radioMode always calls extendRadio (repeatQueue ignored); non-radio unchanged (stop if repeat
  OFF, wrap if ON). servicePlayback stop-check already falls to nextSong for radio on both repeats.
- Root cause 2 (exclusions dead since cf9f526): `exclusions.js` keyed on `config.folderCache`,
  but `useConfig()` returns the STORED config (no folderCache — only `global.config` gets it,
  config.js:28). The `if (!config?.folderCache) return new Set()` guards always fired → excluded
  set always empty → filterExcluded no-op → hidden (#user-exclusive) playlist songs always played.
  Fix: key on `config.url` (storage key, memory key, guards, invalidate). Server-side tag was
  already written correctly; no local data to migrate (guard prevented any writes).
  GOTCHA: config context state ≠ global.config — global.config alone carries computed folderCache.
  Any per-server util keyed on folderCache from a useConfig() config object silently no-ops.
- Files: `app/utils/playerCore.js` (nextSong branch), `app/utils/exclusions.js` (url keying).
  Plan: `plans/radio-loop-exclusions.md`. eslint clean. Build+install pending device verify.

